# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Version control and tooling
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.editorconfig
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Docs are not part of any image
docs/
CLAUDE.md
**/*.md

# Local settings, secrets, and data that must never enter an image
# (CONVENTIONS.md §9)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json

# Test and coverage output
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
